        <mxCell id="kNX8hHAnbDKZl8OYMUNL-37" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Location DBAnd Service:&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;We have 6M driver&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;3M active drivers&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;We have location update every 5 sec so 600 K TPS&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div&gt;We need Query with Lat Long which is two dimensional data&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Explore Geospatial index + with Quadtrees [Post GIS] - easy to handle geo search but not possible for the TPS&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;PostgresSQL limits &amp;lt; than required TPS&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Explore redis geo hashing&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Use Geo sharding for the store&lt;br&gt;try optimizing the location update:&lt;br&gt;Adaptively in the Client side - no major change in location/slow speed location update reduces from 5 sec -&amp;gt; upwards like 1 min&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Driver heartbeat -&amp;gt; unavailabe mark driver status not ready&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
