          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="kNX8hHAnbDKZl8OYMUNL-42" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;p dir=&quot;auto&quot; data-start=&quot;1099&quot; data-end=&quot;1115&quot; class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1099&quot; data-end=&quot;1115&quot;&gt;Ride Request&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1118&quot; data-end=&quot;1662&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;lr14p5&quot; data-start=&quot;1118&quot; data-end=&quot;1177&quot;&gt;Find available drivers in the rider&#39;s H3/geospatial area.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;lr14p5&quot; data-start=&quot;1118&quot; data-end=&quot;1177&quot;&gt;Use ML to find ETA and sort as per ETA ather than relying on distance only.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;lr14p5&quot; data-start=&quot;1118&quot; data-end=&quot;1177&quot;&gt;Use a driver lock tack to hold driver locking as dynamo does not support row level pessimistic locking.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i85g4i&quot; data-start=&quot;1180&quot; data-end=&quot;1322&quot;&gt;Atomically reserve one candidate: &lt;code data-start=&quot;1216&quot; data-end=&quot;1238&quot;&gt;AVAILABLE → RESERVED&lt;/code&gt; using a conditional update/CAS to prevent two rides from selecting the same driver.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ovzdte&quot; data-start=&quot;1325&quot; data-end=&quot;1418&quot;&gt;Release the lock immediately after reservation; don&#39;t hold it while waiting for the driver.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;x1499p&quot; data-start=&quot;1421&quot; data-end=&quot;1482&quot;&gt;Notify the driver and wait for acceptance with a short TTL.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1y2nkcb&quot; data-start=&quot;1485&quot; data-end=&quot;1535&quot;&gt;On acceptance, transition &lt;code data-start=&quot;1513&quot; data-end=&quot;1534&quot;&gt;RESERVED → ASSIGNED&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1scfkcv&quot; data-start=&quot;1538&quot; data-end=&quot;1613&quot;&gt;On rejection/timeout, release the reservation and try the next candidate.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;me13zb&quot; data-start=&quot;1616&quot; data-end=&quot;1662&quot;&gt;Make assignment/retry operations idempotent.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="210" width="460" x="20" y="840" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="kNX8hHAnbDKZl8OYMUNL-43" parent="1" style="shape=process;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;Ride request Queue&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="37" width="80" x="790" y="403" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="kNX8hHAnbDKZl8OYMUNL-47" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;p dir=&quot;auto&quot; data-start=&quot;1099&quot; data-end=&quot;1115&quot; class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1099&quot; data-end=&quot;1115&quot;&gt;Ride Status Update&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1118&quot; data-end=&quot;1662&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;lr14p5&quot; data-start=&quot;1118&quot; data-end=&quot;1177&quot;&gt;leverage Ride service to update ride to started&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;lr14p5&quot; data-start=&quot;1118&quot; data-end=&quot;1177&quot;&gt;Use location Service to fetch driver location data -&amp;gt; Push notif to mark ride complete.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;lr14p5&quot; data-start=&quot;1118&quot; data-end=&quot;1177&quot;&gt;Use the ride service to update the Ride status to completed.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;lr14p5&quot; data-start=&quot;1118&quot; data-end=&quot;1177&quot;&gt;Update driver status to available for rides&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="210" width="460" x="530" y="840" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
